---
import DefaultPageLayout from "../../layouts/DefaultPageLayout.astro";
import Petapetual from "../../components/Petapetual.astro";
import { Image } from "astro:assets";
---

<DefaultPageLayout
    title="Late Friends"
    description="Losing a close friend is a unique pain. Learn how to pay respects & honor their memory. Petapetual offers a peaceful space to build a lasting online tribute for your chosen family."
>
    <article class="article-container">
        <a href="/examples" class="back-link">
            <i class="fas fa-arrow-left"></i> All Use Cases
        </a>

        <Image
            src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1506869640319-fe1a24fd76dc?ixlib=rb-4.1.0&ixid=M3wxMjA3fDB8MHxwaG90by1wYWdlfHx8fGVufDB8fHx8fA%3D%3D&auto=format&fit=crop&q=80&w=2070"
            alt="Friends are the family we choose for ourselves. Honor them today with a Petapetual online memorial and carry them with you wherever you go."
            class="article-hero"
            width="2070"
            height="400"
        />

        <h1 class="article-title">
            <Petapetual /> for late friends
        </h1>

        <p class="article-text">
            Losing a close friend is a unique kind of pain. It's a profound loss
            that can shake you to your core. Friends are the family we choose,
            and their absence leaves a very specific silence. You find yourself
            missing the inside jokes, the easy companionship, and the person who
            understood you in a way that few others do.
        </p>

        <p class="article-text">
            In the midst of that sadness, a powerful need emerges: the desire to
            honor them. We want to celebrate who they were, not just mourn their
            passing. You feel the pull to gather the photos, the shared
            memories, and the funny stories that perfectly capture their unique
            spirit. It's a way to pay respects to the incredible life they lived
            and the special bond you shared.
        </p>

        <p class="article-text">
            This need to share and remember is a vital part of grieving. It's a
            way to keep their light going and to find a sense of community with
            others who are also feeling the loss. We need a place to put that
            love and reflect on the wonderful impact they had on all of our
            lives.
        </p>

        <p class="article-text">
            At <Petapetual />, we understand how important that bond is. We
            created our online memorials to offer a peaceful, dedicated space
            where you can build a beautiful tribute to your friend. It's a place
            to collect those cherished photos, write down the stories that make
            you smile, and invite other friends and family to share their own
            memories. It offers a central place for comfort and celebration,
            ensuring their unique legacy is preserved for everyone to visit,
            anytime.
        </p>

        <div class="article-cta">
            <a href="https://app.petapetual.com" class="cta-btn">
                Create a Memorial <i class="fas fa-arrow-right ml-1"></i>
            </a>
        </div>
    </article>
</DefaultPageLayout>

<style>
    @reference "tailwindcss";

    .article-container {
        @apply flex flex-col gap-6;
    }

    .back-link {
        @apply text-sm no-underline transition-colors;
        color: var(--color-pp-mid);
    }

    .back-link:hover {
        color: var(--color-pp-primary);
    }

    .article-hero {
        @apply w-full h-48 object-cover rounded-xl shadow-sm;
        @apply lg:h-72;
    }

    .article-title {
        @apply text-2xl font-bold;
        @apply lg:text-3xl;
        color: var(--color-pp-primary);
    }

    .article-text {
        @apply leading-relaxed;
        color: var(--color-pp-dark);
    }

    .article-cta {
        @apply mt-4 py-8 text-center;
        border-top: 1px solid
            color-mix(in srgb, var(--color-pp-mid) 30%, transparent);
    }

    .cta-btn {
        @apply inline-block px-6 py-3 rounded-lg font-semibold no-underline transition-colors;
        background-color: var(--color-pp-primary);
        color: var(--color-pp-light);
    }

    .cta-btn:hover {
        opacity: 0.9;
    }
</style>
